---
import { releaseMetadata as release } from '../data/release';
---

<section aria-labelledby="install-title">
  <h2 id="install-title">Install</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the Pawse <code>.dmg</code> from Downloads.</li>
    <li>Drag Pawse into Applications, then eject the disk image.</li>
    <li>Open Pawse from Applications.</li>
    {
      !release.notarized && (
        <li>
          If macOS blocks this build, open <strong>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security</strong>,
          click <strong>Open Anyway</strong> next to Pawse, then confirm with <strong>Open</strong>.
          This is required only once for that build.
        </li>
      )
    }
  </ol>
  <p>
    For screenshots and alternate first-launch paths, see <a href="/docs/install/">Install Pawse</a>.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  section {
    margin-block: 4rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-block: 0.7rem;
    padding-inline-start: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }

  li::marker {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }

</style>
